= Programming with Rudiments using the inetsocketserver class =

Daemons are commonly used to serve data to clients over a network.  This can be done using the [../classes/html/classinetsocketserver.html inetsocketserver class].  The example below listens on an inet socket for a client connection, receives a string from the client, and writes a response back.

